{"id":"wb-5-419","name":"西安城隍庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"西安都城隍庙","text":"西安都城隍庙位于中国陕西省西安市莲湖区北院门街道西大街129号，是陕西和中国西北最大的城隍庙，统辖西北各省城隍。其中大殿是陕西唯一的庑殿式建筑。据说都城隍庙供奉的城隍爷是汉刘邦手下的大将纪信。\n2001年，西安都城隍庙被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%A5%BF%E5%AE%89%E9%83%BD%E5%9F%8E%E9%9A%8D%E5%BA%99","revisionId":91317151,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91317151","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/79b1bae495cb14dbd81abdc0.jpg","title":"Xi'an_Chenghuang_Temple.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Xi%27an_Chenghuang_Temple.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/be/Xi%27an_Chenghuang_Temple.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Acstar","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​西安都城隍庙廊牌楼","width":320,"height":240}}